&lt;p&gt;From: Dollie, To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Photo Info: South First Ave. Martintown, Illinois&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Martintown, Illinois on August 17, 1911&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Am on my to Milford to spend a few days with Freeda before Institute. Write please.&lt;br&gt;
Lovingly,&lt;br&gt;
Dollie&lt;/p&gt;</description>
